    <briefdescription>
<para><formula id="277">$ D_{+} $</formula> matricial representation </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The differential operator <formula id="277">$ D_{+} $</formula> discretizes the first derivative with the first-order formula <formula id="278">\[ \frac{\partial u_{i}}{\partial x} \approx \frac{u_{i+1}-u_{i}}{h} = D_{+} u_{i} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
